OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes into front room of
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has smashed into the front room
OL,7,Fof a house, and ended up on its roof.
OL,9,FFirefighters were called to Chirk Bank,
OL,10,FShropshire, at about 22:20 GMT on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,13,FNobody was in the room at the time of
OL,14,Fthe incident, Shropshire Fire and
OL,15,FRescue Service said, and nobody was
OL,16,Ftrapped inside the vehicle.
OL,18,FCrews from Ellesmere, Oswestry and
OL,19,FWellington attended the crash on the
OL,20,Fnorth Wales border alongside police and
OL,21,Fambulance.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
